IMPORT policy

-- =====================================================================
-- Standing preamble (applies to every query, per inputs/queries-blind.md):
--   "Assuming all other conditions are met and no other exclusions
--   apply (where by 'other' I mean anything not referenced in the
--   query that follows)", and "the agreement has been signed and the
--   premium has been paid on time."
--
-- So, for every q1..q9 below:
--   `agreement signed`   IS TRUE
--   `premium paid month` IS JUST 0
-- and every field not implicated by that question's own facts is set
-- to whatever value is most favorable to coverage (no dispute, no
-- fraud/misrepresentation, no excluded cause, wellness-visit condition
-- satisfied or not yet due), so that the only thing `covered` can turn
-- on is the fact pattern the question actually states.
-- =====================================================================

-- Q1: hospitalized by burns suffered while doing my duty as a
-- firefighter. Stated: cause is Firefighting, causally linked ("while
-- doing my duty as"); the burns are an accidental injury.
q1 MEANS Claim WITH
    `agreement signed`                  IS TRUE
    `premium paid month`                IS JUST 0
    `hospitalization month`             IS 1
    `hospitalization ground`            IS `Accidental injury`
    `age at hospitalization`            IS 30
    `causes`                            IS LIST Firefighting
    `fraud month`                       IS NOTHING
    `misrepresentation month`           IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit month`              IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit provider qualified` IS TRUE
    `written confirmation month`        IS NOTHING
    `dispute arisen`                    IS FALSE
    `unable to settle month`            IS NOTHING
    `arbitration commenced month`       IS NOTHING
    `valid arbitration award issued`    IS FALSE
    `written proof of claim month`      IS NOTHING
    `recovery sought month`             IS NOTHING
    `policy term months`                IS 12

