-- Q3: hospitalized for pneumonia 5 months after the effective date;
-- age 65. Stated: ground Sickness, hospitalization month 5, age 65.
-- Since month 5 is before the month-7 checkpoint, Section 1.3 is
-- "still pending" regardless of the (unstated) wellness-visit facts.
q3 MEANS Claim WITH
    `agreement signed`                  IS TRUE
    `premium paid month`                IS JUST 0
    `hospitalization month`             IS 5
    `hospitalization ground`            IS Sickness
    `age at hospitalization`            IS 65
    `causes`                            IS EMPTY
    `fraud month`                       IS NOTHING
    `misrepresentation month`           IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit month`              IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit provider qualified` IS TRUE
    `written confirmation month`        IS NOTHING
    `dispute arisen`                    IS FALSE
    `unable to settle month`            IS NOTHING
    `arbitration commenced month`       IS NOTHING
    `valid arbitration award issued`    IS FALSE
    `written proof of claim month`      IS NOTHING
    `recovery sought month`             IS NOTHING
    `policy term months`                IS 12

-- Q4: hospitalized due to a fall while traveling abroad; confirmation
-- of the wellness visit was given 8 months after the effective date.
-- Stated: ground `Accidental injury` (a fall); `written confirmation
-- month` JUST 8 (past the 7-month deadline in Section 1.3). Location
-- ("abroad") is not a Claim field — Section 3.1.1 already makes it
-- irrelevant. `hospitalization month` is not stated; it is set to 8 so
-- the stated, late-confirmation fact is actually operative (hospital-
-- ization is at/after the point the confirmation was "already" given,
-- and Section 1.3's month-7 checkpoint has passed by then). The
-- wellness visit's own month is unstated and unrelated to what this
-- question tests, so it is set favorably (well before month 6).
q4 MEANS Claim WITH
    `agreement signed`                  IS TRUE
    `premium paid month`                IS JUST 0
    `hospitalization month`             IS 8
    `hospitalization ground`            IS `Accidental injury`
    `age at hospitalization`            IS 30
    `causes`                            IS EMPTY
    `fraud month`                       IS NOTHING
    `misrepresentation month`           IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit month`              IS JUST 3
    `wellness visit provider qualified` IS TRUE
    `written confirmation month`        IS JUST 8
    `dispute arisen`                    IS FALSE
    `unable to settle month`            IS NOTHING
    `arbitration commenced month`       IS NOTHING
    `valid arbitration award issued`    IS FALSE
    `written proof of claim month`      IS NOTHING
    `recovery sought month`             IS NOTHING
    `policy term months`                IS 12

